<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     10.25 /10.15   10.50 /10.40    11.425/11.35</p>
<p> Citibank		10.25 /10.20   10.60 /10.50    11.25 /11.05</p>
<p> Metrobank	     10.25 /10.00   10.585/10.395   11.00 /10.75</p>
<p> PNB		     10.40 /10.20   10.75 /10.50    11.40 /10.90</p>
<p> Security Bank	 10.35 /10.20   10.65 /10.40    11.375/11.00</p>
<p> Solidbank	     10.305/10.205  10.70 /10.60    11.25 /11.15</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8938</p>
